{"ref":"BDB, גִּלְבֹּעַ","hw":"גִּלְבֹּעַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלְבֹּעַ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. Gilboaʿ (</strong>derivation unknown<strong>)</strong>, mountain-ridge at S.E. end of plain of Jezreel, where Saul & Jonathan were killed; usually c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר הַגּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.1\">1 S 31:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.8\">8</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.6\">2 S 1:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֵי בַּגִּלְבֹּעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.21\">2 S 1:21</a> (David’s lament); <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּגּ׳</span> alone <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.4\">1 S 28:4</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.12\">2 S 21:12</a>; without art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר גִּלְבֹּעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.1\">1 Ch 10:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.8\">8</a> (‖ <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.1\">1 S 31:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.8\">8</a> supr.);—mod. <em>Jebel Fuḳûʿa</em> Bd<sup>Pal. 244</sup>.","next":"BDB, גַּלְגַּל","prev":"BDB, גַּלָּב"}